; TAG 120715: for now the requirement for sbj-f (manswb) is hard-coded here (should be in ara-types-verb-lex)
; Also, the requirement for the same CNCRD value as the head of the complement is defined here. The structure-sharing mechanism does not 
; work. At the VP-level the CNCRD is unspecified. 
1n := arg12_v_subj-raising_sbj_le & 
 [ STEM < "1n" >, 
   SYNSEM.LKEYS.KEYREL.PRED _1n_v_rel,
   SYNSEM.LOCAL.CAT.HEAD.CNCRD #png,
   SYNSEM.LOCAL.CAT [ VAL.DEP2.DEP.LOCAL.CONT.HOOK.INDEX.E.MOOD sbj-f,
                      HEAD.CNCRD #png ] ].
                      
